(1. PURPOSE) Tj T*
(This procedure defines how complaint handling is carried out at Northfield.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. SCOPE) Tj T*
(Applies to all complaint handling activities in production and quality control at Northfield \(revised in revision 02\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. RESPONSIBILITIES) Tj T*
(The process owner, Jonas Quiroga, maintains this procedure. Quality approves it.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. PROCEDURE) Tj T*
(Step 1: Document the area is free of previous materials.) Tj T*
(Step 2: Escalate the result against the acceptance criterion.) Tj T*
(Step 3: Verify the second-person check.) Tj T*
(Step 4: Record the batch number.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5. RECORDS) Tj T*
(Records of complaint handling are kept for five years after batch expiry.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
